Furniture handle is also an important knowledge for whole house customization
Handles are assembled on doors, windows, chests of drawers, kitchen cabinets and other furniture, and have the functions of pushing, pulling and pumping, which are beneficial to the power switch. The handle can not only have the effect of saving human resources and making life convenient, but at the same time, it will also bring good decoration effect if it is properly matched.
Selection of kitchen handles for restaurants: The kitchen cabinet handles do not need to be textured too much, because the kitchen in the restaurant is frequently used, the kitchen fumes are relatively large, and the handles with too many textures are not easy to clean after the kitchen fumes are attached. And should choose durable, corrosion-resistant raw materials, aluminum alloy profile raw material handle is a very good choice for restaurant kitchen.
Selection of the handle of the shoe rack: high attention should be paid to its versatility, and a single-headed handle with a color close to the control panel should be selected, so as not to hinder the host’s application.
Selection of bathroom handle: The handle of the bathroom door is used more frequently, so it is necessary to buy a handle with better quality and a higher frequency of power switch. In addition, there are few cabinet doors in the bathroom, and it is suitable to choose a small double-headed spherical handle made of porcelain or plexiglass, whose color or material should be similar to that of the cabinet.
Handle selection in children’s room: In order to care about safety in the children’s room, it is best to have a handle on the floor plan of the equipment, or simply choose a design without a handle. The embedded handle is especially suitable for a room with children, because it has no obvious corners, and it is not easy for children to accidentally knock down.
