The bucket elevator is equipped with electrical and mechanical protection devices. It is equipped with an on-site control cabinet and remote control interface to ensure that it can automatically stop and give an alarm when the chain is broken, the chain is dropped, the jam, and the material is blocked.
The connection between the chain bucket and the chain adopts high-strength bolt connection.
There is a positioning device in the middle of the bucket elevator to prevent the shell from moving sideways, and it can move freely in the vertical direction. The movement caused by thermal expansion cannot affect the connection and sealing of the discharge port.
Due to the high temperature of the conveying material, the sprocket at the head and tail of the bucket elevator should adopt a double-rim structure suitable for high-strength chains to avoid possible chain suspension. The gear teeth adopt ZG310-540, surface quenching treatment, hardness It is HRC45-50.
The driving device of the bucket elevator should be equipped with a backstop to prevent the sudden power failure from causing the reverse movement of the material hopper and causing equipment damage. The motor of the drive device should meet the requirements of rainproof and dustproof, its protection level is not less than IP54, and the insulation level is F. Motor bearings adopt SKF brand bearings.
The chain-breaking protector is installed on the tail shaft and rotates with the shaft. When the tail shaft speed of the bucket elevator is abnormal due to overload operation, jamming, etc., the control cabinet will alarm and stop automatically to ensure the safety of the equipment.
