The operator of the palletizing and packaging machine should do the following: “Three Goods”, “Four Meetings”, “Four Requirements”, and “Five Rules for Lubrication”, strictly abide by the five disciplines, and keep the equipment in good condition.
⑴ Manage the equipment well: The operator shall be responsible for keeping the equipment used by himself, and shall not allow others to operate and use it without approval. Accessories, parts, tools and technical data are kept clean and must not be lost.
⑶ Repair the equipment: Strictly implement the maintenance procedures, understand the equipment performance and operating principles, troubleshoot in time, cooperate with the maintenance workers to repair the equipment and participate in the commissioning and acceptance work.
⑴ Will use: Familiar with the performance, structure, and working principle of the equipment, learn and master the operating procedures, and be proficient and accurate in operating techniques.
⑶ Inspection: be familiar with the equipment structure, performance, know the process standards and inspection items, and check and judge the technical conditions of each part of the equipment according to the requirements of the spot inspection; be able to identify the abnormal phenomenon and the occurrence part of the equipment, and find out the cause; Judge the technical status of the equipment according to its integrity standards.
⑵ Cleaning: clean inside and outside of the equipment, no dust, no yellow robe, no black matter, no rust; no grease on all sliding surfaces, screws, gears, etc. ; no water or oil leaks at all parts; clean up the cutting waste.
⑷ Safety: implement a fixed schedule and shift shift system; familiar with the structure and performance of the equipment; careful maintenance and reasonable use; various safety protection devices are complete and reliable, the control system is normal, and the grounding is good, and there is no hidden danger of accidents.
⑵ Keep the equipment clean and refuel as required;
Purpose: Keep the equipment clean, tidy, well lubricated, safe and reliable.
The electrical part is taken care of by the maintenance electrician. Purpose: Keep the equipment well lubricated, reduce equipment wear, eliminate hidden dangers of equipment accidents, achieve yellow gown removal, internal organ cleaning, paint see the original color iron see light, oil passage, oil window bright, flexible operation, normal operation, and keep the equipment in good condition .
