This food, in addition to being nutritious, is very tasty and can be used in various recipes, improving their flavor and quality. But what is the difference between these 3 types of cheese?
That's what we will discover and learn in this article. So if you want to know what differences between minas cheese, cottage cheese and ricotta cheese, stay with me until the end of the article and learn which one is the most suitable for you, who practices weight training.
First of all it is good to explain that the traditional Minas cheese is different from Queijo minas frescal, both in consistency and in the amount of calories. The traditional mine is harder and a little more yellowish.
On average, a serving of approximately 100 grams of traditional minas cheese contains about 399 calories, unlike the minas frescal cheese that the same amount contains 203 calories. Thus, we saw that minas frescal cheese is healthier than traditional cheese.
Its composition contains a lower dose of milk, so the amount of calories and fats are much lower. In addition, this type of cheese is very popular with bodybuilders because it is rich in proteins.
In addition, this cheese is also rich in vitamins and minerals, containing Complex B vitamins, Vitamin A, phosphorus, calcium and etc. Its amount of protein is approximately 12g of protein for every 100g.
O ricotta cheese it is a different type of cheese because it contains such a specific flavor and can be included, both in savory recipes, as in sweets. This type of cheese is also recommended to be included in diets, although it has a higher number of calories than cottage cheese, it is still healthier than many other cheeses.
In addition, cottage cheese is an excellent source of protein, which makes it the most suitable for those who practice weight training. In a 100g serving, it contains about 12 grams of protein.
However, even if you choose Minas cheese, because you like the taste better, or for another reason, know that moderate consumption will not harm you and will not make you fat.
Unfortunately, some people are not privileged to be able to enjoy most cheeses. Many people nowadays have a disease called lactose intolerance, which is a disease where you cannot consume the carbohydrate in milk, which is lactose, which is also present in cheese.
For those with hypertension problems, the most suitable cheese is ricotta cheese, as it contains much less sodium than the others. Therefore, these individuals will be able to enjoy the taste and benefits of such cheeses without risking their health.
