Tattoos to remember deceased father
Many people choose to get an EKG tattoo in order to remember their deceased father. The electrocardiogram usually symbolizes love, life and hope.
There are other people who decide to take a portrait of the face of their deceased father along with his name and the date of birth and death. In this case, the design is basic based on black and white shadows to enhance the realism of said tattoo.
As you can see, there are a lot of options when it comes to getting a tattoo, that helps to remember the figure of a deceased father. It is important that the chosen design helps you feel the great love you professed towards your father.
In this way the person can see it whenever they want and be able to remember the important figure of the father at all times. The areas of the body most used when making a design on a deceased father are usually the arms, legs, feet or hands.
