What is the general power of an outdoor LED display?
Secondly, the calculation method of the power of the outdoor led display screen:
Usually the power supply voltage we use is 5V, power supply is 30A and 40A; single color led display is 8 modules and 1 40A power supply, and dual colors led screen are 6 modules in 1 power supply;
If you want to make 9 square meters of indoor P5 two-color LED display, calculate the maximum power required.
The method of calculating the power of the LED display screen is to calculate the number of du points, 0.3W/point * total points is the total power, and the maximum power is multiplied by a factor of 1.3.
The above is a brief introduction about outdoor LED display power and calculation method, hope it will be helpful for you.
