News - What is a LED display made of ? Do you know the components of led screen?
LED display is made up of two parts: the led cabinets and the display control system.
Another part is the control system. the control system can also be divided into two parts: control board( hardware) and control system( software).
Multifarious displays with different specifications, control systems and different control technology ( such as video processor and multifunction card) can be constituted into various kinds of LED screens to satisfy different application environments with diverse requirements.
There are die casting cabinets with fixed sizes design for rental display and there are steel cabinets and aluminum cabinets with customized sizes for common display.
Switching Power Supply It is used to transform the 220V or 110V alternating current into 5V output direct current to support the LED modules working.
It’s function is to cushion the data, generate all kinds of scanning signals and duty cycle grey scale control signals.
