As the first generation of display technology, the traditional SMD display has been very mature after more than ten years of development.
With the development of LED display technology, technical routes such as COB（Which short for Chip On Board） comes out.
SMD, as known as surface mounted devices, refers to using surface mount technology to package LED products.
When producing the display unit with different spacing for mini LED display screens, the lamp bead is welded to the circuit board by high-speed SMT machine with high-temperature reflow welding.
SMD is the primary technology for micro LED display screens with pixel spacing less than 10mm on the market.
Therefore, the COB-LED will be freed from the physical size of the SMD for higher resolution like P0.9375.
Compared to SMD, what COB led display can brings the benefit to you as below:
One of the aims of this technology is to deal with the problem of heat dissipation of SMD and DIP.
2; Suitable for narrow pixel pitch LED Display
5; Better Anti-collision
The reason for the high reliability is that COB technology can eliminate the control link in the single lamp production process.
It supports the all-weather operation and can still operate in extreme temperatures in -30 to +80 degrees.
